  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "860145f5-efe4-48a8-8ab6-be5d4990992c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Some more information about the drawing tool:\n",
    "- You can save your drawing by putting filename=\"(name)\" as an input parameter\n",
    "- The positions are shifted so that the first vertex is always at position (0.5, 0.5)\n",
    "- Currently, drawing is only available for 2-dimensions"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5c2a251a-0814-4fe0-abf4-a1f3929e0c17",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Parameters"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0a847b1f-0e69-4446-9c82-170e7a73157b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The sphere of influence of a vertex v at time t is given by (A1*deg^-(v) + A2)/t. Thus, changing A1 will affect the power law exponent of the degree sequence, and changing A2 will affect the overall density. "
   ]
  },
